  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Signalling procedure of energy efficient device-to-device communication for IMT-2020 network</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Signalling procedure of energy efficient device-to-device communication for IMT-2020 network</title>
